---
source: crates/chillguard-cli/tests/render.rs
expression: "render::playground(&started)"
---
The ChillGuard playground is running.

  dashboard  http://localhost:8642/chillguard/
  runtime    chillguard-play (in memory: nothing is kept once it stops)
  endpoint   tcp/127.0.0.1:20124

On the page, press a button under "Development controls" and watch the card.
From a terminal, the same refrigerator:

  export MYRMIC_CONNECT=tcp/127.0.0.1:20124
  chillguard status
  chillguard simulate power_failure_2h

Stop it with `chillguard stop`. The guide is docs/playground/README.md.

Note: the dashboard's port is open to other machines on this network, and its
buttons work without a login. It is a simulated refrigerator; stop it when done.
